         row B[k, j], never as a destination. Because i < k, row k has not
         been updated yet when it is read, so B[k, j] still equals B_in[k, j].
         After this stage:

           B[i, j] = B_in[i, j] +
                     sum_{k = i+1}^{m-1} A[k, i] * B_in[k, j]

      2. Global scaling:
           for i in [0, m), j in [0, n):
             B[i, j] = alpha * B[i, j]

